# Ignore `packages/design-system`

Treat **`packages/design-system`** as out of bounds for this repo’s agents.

## Hard rule

- **Do not** read to edit, write, delete, rename, commit, or run build/codegen scripts that change anything under `packages/design-system/**`.
- **Do not** “fix” fonts, tokens, Lit components, `ds2.config.json`, `dist/`, or package exports inside that tree — even if the app looks broken because of them.
- **Do not** add Google Fonts / Montserrat (or any other) loading in the app to compensate; font and token ownership stays in the design-system package (maintained elsewhere).
- The app may **import and consume** published exports (e.g. `@jobzeug/design-system`, `@jobzeug/design-system/tokens.css`, `JzButton`). That is use, not ownership.

## If something in the design system seems wrong

Say what you observed and what would need to change in the design-system package. Stop. Do not patch it from this workspace.
